---
title: "invest (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_time: caller invokes invest(amount, signature)
    q_validate_time --> q_check_prefund: check block.timestamp
    q_check_prefund --> q_validate_sig: prefundStartTime <= now <= prefundEndTime
    q_check_prefund --> q_check_active: now > prefundEndTime
    q_check_active --> q_validate_sig: startTime <= now <= endTime
    q_check_active --> q_revert_time: outside valid period
    q_revert_time --> [*]: revert InvalidTiming
    q_validate_sig --> q_verify_signer: verify signature against authorized signer
    q_verify_signer --> q_revert_sig: signature invalid
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_verify_signer --> q_check_min: signature valid
    q_check_min --> q_revert_min: amount < minimumInvestAmount
    q_revert_min --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvestment
    q_check_min --> q_transfer: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_transfer --> q_update: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update --> q_emit: position.totalInvested += amount; totalCapitalInvested += amount
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Invested(investor, amount)

    note right of q_validate_sig
        INV-001: Only authorized Legion signers can produce valid signatures
        INV-002: Each investment must meet minimumInvestAmount threshold
    end note

    note right of q_check_prefund
        INV-003: Prefund period precedes active sale period with allocation gap between
        INV-004: Investment is suspended during pre-fund allocation period
    end note
